{"version":1,"content":"<p>陸劇小生楊洋出道17年，期間先後演出時裝甜寵劇《微微一笑很傾城》及《你是我的榮耀》而爆紅，不過自從3年前他夥拍王楚然主演《我的人間煙火》，被狠批演技及造型如「油膩大叔」，加上兩人緋聞傳過沒完沒了，楊洋事業一度跌落新低點，他亦暫別現偶劇演出，</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T01:20:44.732157+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T01:01:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T01:18:07.504184+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T01:18:07.504184+00:00","content_hash":"b5f9c7ef70ec49adb9bae06df25d7274a87dac1cb294ff95aabfb54fd60eaa70","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}